    "title": "Bracey's 3-pointer lifts Averett University men's basketball to upset of No. 2 Randolph-Macon College in ODAC play - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Davin Wilson ,\n43 minutes ago DANVILLE, Va. — Redshirt sophomore Timayahs Bracey knocked down the go-ahead 3-pointer late in the game and the Averett University men’s basketball held on the rest of the way for a 62-60 upset win over No. 2 Randolph-Macon College in Old Dominion Athletic Conference (ODAC) action at the Grant Center Wednesday night. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
